#org @gText_TheImpactSite_ResearchLab_ShipDeliveredPlayerToOlimar
[PLAYER] is finally here.\nCan I do something else now?

#org @gText_TheImpactSite_ResearchLab_OlimarWantsToShowPlayerSomething
Oh, [PLAYER]! I'm so glad you accepted\nmy invitation! Come, come. I need\lto show you something.

#org @gText_TheImpactSite_ResearchLab_ShipWantsToLeave
