#org @gText_TheImpactSite_ResearchLab_OlimarBloomingOnionInvention
This is the invention I mentioned in\nmy message.\pMy proudest accomplishment[.]\pThe [RED]Blooming Onion[BLUE]!

#org @gText_TheImpactSite_ResearchLab_OlimarAsksPlayerAboutBloomingOnionInside
I'm sure you know what these\ncontain, right?

#org @gText_TheImpactSite_ResearchLab_OlimarTakeSilenceAsYesGoAndPickStarter
I'll take your silence as a yes!\nNow go ahead and pick one!\pI'd like to formally introduce these\n'Pikmon' to you.
